0..72 Comment "// The loop space\'s equivalence, one stratum down from the book\'s circle"
73..150 Comment "// (Theorem 8.1.9): spinning, the fold out of the presented integers into the"
151..227 Comment "// loop\'s words, undoes the winding number and the winding number undoes it,"
